Oh if you are looking for a good list of moderation labellers:

General moderation: 
@skywatch.blue @moderation.blacksky.app @arttheft.bsky.social @asukafield.xyz (not perfect but good signals)

Useful signals for noticing bad actors: 
@stechlab-labels.bsky.social @labeler.hailey.at

It's a couple! They're atproto/Bluesky apps call labelers. They're for mod actions to label things, but people use them for fun projects. They show up on the app and website

